Looking at the issue, I need to find the actual keyboard.json file for the DOIO KB16 rev1 keyboard and add the resolution fix for the large knob.

Based on the issue description, the fix is to add `"resolution": 2` to the third encoder entry (index 2, pins D7/D6) which corresponds to the large knob.

